 "text": "TOP\n573-545-3549\nDirectory\nContact\nDirectory\nCounty Departments\nCommunities\nProfile\nPay Taxes\nElection Information\nContact\nHome\nLocating the Scott County Courthouse\nHome\nLocating the Scott County Courthouse\nThe Scott County Courthouse is located on U.S. Highway 61 (Winchester Street) in Benton. If traveling from Interstate 55, take Exit #80 (MO-77 Exit), and turn west onto Highway 77 which will take you into Benton. At U.S. Highway 61, turn left (south) and the Courthouse will be on your right.\nContact Us\nScott County Mo\nP.O. Box 188 :: 131 S. Winchester Street\nBenton, Missouri 63736\nPhone: 573-545-3549 Fax: 573-545-3540\nDepartments | Careers | Login | Form Login\n** Designed & Hosted By:\nCreative Design Group **\nTop\nClose\nContact Us",
